  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production of all-natural guacamole and avocado oil in Nicaragua</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Applicant Grupo Agroindustrial Puntarenas S.A. is a producer of fruit and vegetable juices for the wholesale and retail market, seeking to diversify its product portfolio in the Costa Rican market.Local partner Inversiones Gonz&#xE1;lez Rappaccioli S.A. is a producer of avocados for the fresh market.Approximately 10% of avocado production gets rejected as fruits do not meet fresh market quality standards. Together, the partners identified the business opportunity to process fresh avocados to all-F14-natural, shelf-stable guacamole and avocado oil for the Costa Rican market or the international cosmetic market. For this purpose, the partners will establish a factory in Nicaragua to produce guacamole and avocado oil, to be sold through the existing marketing and sales network of applicant Puntarenas. The partners will conclude long-term supply agreements with 12 avocado producers during the follow-up phase. The pilot project will generate 52 full-time positions. During spin-off, employment will grow to 97 FTEs. Partners will establish a joint venture. The project is new for Nicaragua as currently no industrial processing of avocado takes place in Nicaragua.</narrative>
  </description>
